{"id":13212,"date":"2025-11-03T21:28:07","date_gmt":"2025-11-03T21:28:07","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?post_type=person&#038;p=13212"},"modified":"2025-11-03T22:16:34","modified_gmt":"2025-11-03T22:16:34","slug":"mohammed-salifu","status":"publish","type":"person","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/person\/mohammed-salifu\/","title":{"rendered":"Prof. Mohammed Salifu"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover profile-banner bg-alt\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-100 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:none\"><\/span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n\n\n<a href=\"javascript:history.back()\"> <div class=\"profiles-btn\"> \n\n<div class=\"btn-left-sq bg-primary\"> <i class=\"fa fa-caret-left white-text\"> <\/i> <\/div>\n<div class=\"btn-text title-bold white-text\">Back to Profiles<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n<\/a>\n\n<h2 class=\"profile-name\">Prof. Mohammed Salifu<\/h2>\n\n<ul class=\"profile-list prof-pos\" style=\"list-style:none;\"><li class=\"profile-position\"> Director-General<\/li><li class=\"profile-position\"> Ghana Tertiary Education Commission<\/li><\/ul>\n\n<p class=\"profile-info profile-tagline primary-bold prof-pos\"><span class=\"primary-text is-bold\"><\/span><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5 profile-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/11\/Prof-Salifu_-website-e1619772264876-300x300-1.jpg\"\/>\n\n\n<p>Mohammed Salifu is the Director-General of the Ghana Tertiary Education Commission (GTEC). With over two decades of experience in higher education, he has contributed extensively through teaching, research, and service to industry and communities, as a transportation and road transport safety and logistics expert.<br>He is a Professor of Transport Engineering in the Department of Civil Engineering at the Kwame Nkrumah University of Science and Technology (KNUST), where he previously served as Head of Department from 2010 to 2014.<br>He also held the position of Head of the Traffic and Transportation Engineering Division at the Council for Scientific and Industrial Research (CSIR) from 2004 to 2006. A Fellow of the Ghana Institution of Engineers (GhIE), he served as their national Vice-President and Head of Education and Training from 2011 to 2012.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Mohammed Salifu is the Director-General of the Ghana Tertiary Education Commission (GTEC). With over two decades of experience in higher education, he has contributed extensively through teaching, research, and service to industry and communities, as a transportation and road transport safety and logistics expert.He is a Professor of Transport Engineering in the Department of Civil<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":17,"featured_media":13213,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":"","profile-name":"Prof. Mohammed Salifu","profile-position":" Director-General, Ghana Tertiary Education Commission","profile-tagline":""},"tags":[],"people_types":[10],"acf":[],"featured_img":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/11\/Prof-Salifu_-website-e1619772264876-300x300-1.jpg","coauthors":[],"author_meta":{"author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/seyram\/","display_name":"seyram"},"relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 3 weeks ago","modified":"Updated 3 weeks ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on November 3, 2025","modified":"Updated on November 3, 2025"},"absolute_dates_time":{"created":"Posted on November 3, 2025 9:28 pm","modified":"Updated on November 3, 2025 10:16 pm"},"featured_img_caption":"","tax_additional":{"post_tag":{"linked":[],"unlinked":[],"slug":"post_tag","name":"Tags"},"people_types":{"linked":["<a href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/person_type\/board\/\" class=\"advgb-post-t